for (int i = 0; i < n; i++)
    for (int j = i; j < n; j++) work();          // n + (n-1) + ... = n(n+1)/2

// Case 3: O(n) - inner runs a FIXED 5 times, not n
for (int i = 0; i < n; i++)
    for (int j = 0; j < 5; j++) work();          // n * 5 = O(n)
```
Always read the inner loop's bound: `j < n` differs from `j < 5`.

